\f2\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Security analysts serve as the first responders to digital threats. Tasks and duties include:\
Continuous Monitoring: Observing SIEM dashboards 24/7/365 for anomalous activity.\
Alert Triage: Separating "noise" (false positives) from genuine attacks (true positives).\
Incident Investigation: Using endpoint telemetry (EDR) and network logs to reconstruct attack timelines.\
Containment & Eradication: Taking technical actions like isolating infected hosts, revoking credentials, or blocking malicious IPs.\
\

